{"id":"lebhart","name":"lebhart","aliases":[],"caption":"Write your articles in a colorful way","authors":[{"id":"xu","active":true}],"copyright":[{"owner":"Jinwen XU","year":"2021-2026"}],"license":"lppl1.3c","version":{"number":"","date":"2026-02-20"},"descriptions":[{"language":null,"text":"<p>\n      This package provides a LaTeX class for typesetting articles\n      with a colorful design.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      Currently, it has native support for Chinese (simplified and\n      traditional), English, French, German, Italian, Japanese,\n      Portuguese (European and Brazilian), Russian and Spanish\n      typesetting. It compiles with either XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      This is part of the <ref refid=\"colorist\">colorist<\u002fref>\n      class series and depends on <tt>colorist.sty<\u002ftt> from\n      the <ref refid=\"colorist\">colorist<\u002fref> package.\n    <\u002fp>\n  <p>\n      The package name <q>lebhart<\u002fq> is taken from the German word\n      <q>lebhaft<\u002fq> (<q>vivid<\u002fq>), combined with the first three letters\n      of <q>Artikel<\u002fq> (<q>article<\u002fq>).\n    <\u002fp>"}],"documentation":[{"language":null,"details":"Readme","href":"ctan:/macros/unicodetex/latex/lebhart/README.md"}],"repository":"https://github.com/Jinwen-XU/colorist/tree/main/lebhart","ctan":{"path":"/macros/unicodetex/latex/lebhart","file":true},"miktex":"lebhart","texlive":"lebhart","topics":["article-like","class","multilingual","chinese"],"also":["colorist"]}